      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "**activityType**: The type of the service that was selected by the user. For custom services, this is the value returned by the [`activityType`](uiactivity/activitytype-swift.property.md) method of a [`UIActivity`](uiactivity.md) object. For system-defined activities, it is one of the strings listed in “Built-in Activity Types” in [`UIActivity`](uiactivity.md).",
